                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "Hey folks,<br><br>Have you ever explained something to someone and realised halfway through that you didn’t fully understand it yourself?<br><br>That happened to me this week. I was writing up how I use AI tools, and had to map out my whole workflow, step by step. It sounds simple. It wasn’t.<br><br>Writing it down showed me patterns I hadn’t noticed. AI wasn’t helping with the writing so much as with collecting ideas and editing. The writing is still me, for better or worse.<br><br>Have a lovely weekend, and I’ll see you next Friday!",
